<b>Una experiencia de carga confiable y segura<\/b><\/p><p>Este cargador est\u00e1 equipado con m\u00faltiples funciones de seguridad avanzadas para proteger sus dispositivos conectados y su cargador. Los mecanismos integrados de protecci\u00f3n t\u00e9rmica, contra cortocircuitos y sobrecarga protegen contra posibles contratiempos, brind\u00e1ndole tranquilidad durante cada sesi\u00f3n de carga.<\/p><br><\/div><div><h2>ESPECIFICACIONES T\u00c9CNICAS<\/h2><p><ul><li>Serie GaN2 Ultra<\/li><li>Fuerza 35W<\/li><li>Longitud 8cm<\/li><li>Ancho 4cm<\/li><li>Altura 3 cent\u00edmetros<\/li><li>Peso 57,00 gramos<\/li><li>Tipo de salida Carga r\u00e1pida USB-A 3.0, USB-C PD<\/li><li>N\u00famero de salidas 2<\/li><li>Salida 1 USB-C PD \/ 35 W<\/li><li>Salida 2 Carga r\u00e1pida USB-A 3.0 \/ 18 W<\/li><li>Material ABS reciclado<\/li><\/ul><\/p><br><\/div>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"XTORM","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":0.14,"unit_price":18.93,"unit_price_tax":18.93,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Accesorios de SmartPhones","sub_category":"Cargadores para Smartphones","quantity":5,"brand":"XTORM","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_xto-carga%20xec035_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":13.93}}},"6922794778610":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["6922794778610",false],"wholesale_price":[60.13,false],"price":[65.13,false],"id_tax_rules_group":[1,false],"categorys":["1 categorys",false],"weight":["Product weight is 0.18",false],"images":["Create 1 images",false],"tags":["Product without tags",false],"features":["Product without features",true],"combinations":["Product without combinations",true]},"need_alert":tru